DESCRIPTION:Cuentos Del Arbol (Tree Tales)A delightful bilingual musical d
 rawn from Spanish and Latin American Folklore.“Cuentos del Árbol” is 
 a bilingual musical drawn from Spanish and Latin American folklore. The pl
 ay is designed to bring Spanish to life and make theatre accessible to stu
 dents\, parents and grandparents for whom English is a second language.The
  centerpiece of all the “tales” is a tree (Un Árbol) that has shelter
 ed\, shielded and nurtured countless characters who have passed her way ov
 er the
